{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc7b Cute vibes + Cooking Tycoon + Crafting \ud83c\udf73</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\ude93 Life Sim + Roguelite + Max 4 player co-op \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras/Wishlist_EN.png?t=1742720702\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Haunted Delivery Restaurant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras/Gif_Order.gif?t=1742720702\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playful, picky, and sometimes downright indecisive\u2014ghost customers are never easy to please. Choose and deliver meals that satisfy their mysterious cravings\u2026 if you can figure them out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Simulation &amp; Co-op Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras/Gif_Well.gif?t=1742720702\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn\u2019t just about taking orders and cooking. You\u2019ll need to <strong>explore, hunt, farm, forage, mine, and chop wood</strong> to gather ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sounds like a lot? Why not team up with friends? Just remember\u2014the kitchen only fits <strong>four</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Roguelite Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588570/extras/Gif_Wheat.gif?t=1742720702\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A haunted forest where <strong>poltergeists run wild and the world shifts daily</strong>\u2014nothing stays the same for long. Explore ever-changing regions, face unexpected surprises, and don\u2019t be alarmed 